{"2168230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gun Swinger", "steam_appid": 2168230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Don't think! Don't walk! Just keep on swinging!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gun Swinger there is <strong>no floor!</strong> Use your bungee to <strong>swing</strong> your self through the world! There is no stopping!<br>Use your momentum to boost your powers with<strong> Velocity Speed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/08d5143f45da01fbd71977f6f3fe0b41.avif?t=1770497113\" width=872 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fire away your heart pounding blistering fast weapons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your arsenal of weapons to defeat all enemies standing in your way!<br>With high velocity and extreme motion you will burn a way through the world!<br>Test your limits! Feel the music! Bring your ambition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/d1109d34aae704b0353a79a0f10388f6.avif?t=1770497113\" width=913 height=205 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect coins to gain upgrades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemies to generate gold that leads to upgrades that increases your speeds and capabilities!<br>Reach <strong>tremendous</strong> raging speeds! <strong>Destroy</strong> your enemies! <strong>Blaze</strong> your way through the worlds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Never stop! Never give up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guns never sleep! Neither can you! In Gun Swinger you can <strong>never stop</strong> for a break! Always keep the <strong>momentum</strong>!<br>Always keep the blazing burning! Always keep your <strong>heart pounding</strong> and <strong>pulse flowing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/e3d6ca016295ea105ed4f47bbf3a7a25.avif?t=1770497113\" width=1179 height=411 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve puzzles, feel the music</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, find hidden locks to open gates while swinging your way through the different fantastic worlds.<br>No area is the same! Use your creativity to overcome obstacles! All while enjoining <strong><i>Gun Swingers Original Themes!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/cad5983cb8e918bb5f14c928e99a3f64.avif?t=1770497113\" width=1298 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Let your creativity flow! Endless possibilities! <i><u>Endless fun!</u></i> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination take you away! <strong><u>Create your own levels!</u></strong> Using the <strong>In game Level Creator!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build walls! Build puzzles! Spawn enemies! Program gates! Build your own worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/c92afa4f3aa116a6bd23b7651485d791.avif?t=1770497113\" width=939 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your worlds! Share them with friends! How far can you stretch your own or others imaginations and skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u><br>Welcome To The World Of Gun Swinger!</u></i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Don't think! Don't walk! Just keep on swinging!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gun Swinger there is <strong>no floor!</strong> Use your bungee to <strong>swing</strong> your self through the world! There is no stopping!<br>Use your momentum to boost your powers with<strong> Velocity Speed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/08d5143f45da01fbd71977f6f3fe0b41.avif?t=1770497113\" width=872 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fire away your heart pounding blistering fast weapons!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your arsenal of weapons to defeat all enemies standing in your way!<br>With high velocity and extreme motion you will burn a way through the world!<br>Test your limits! Feel the music! Bring your ambition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/d1109d34aae704b0353a79a0f10388f6.avif?t=1770497113\" width=913 height=205 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect coins to gain upgrades!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemies to generate gold that leads to upgrades that increases your speeds and capabilities!<br>Reach <strong>tremendous</strong> raging speeds! <strong>Destroy</strong> your enemies! <strong>Blaze</strong> your way through the worlds!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Never stop! Never give up!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your guns never sleep! Neither can you! In Gun Swinger you can <strong>never stop</strong> for a break! Always keep the <strong>momentum</strong>!<br>Always keep the blazing burning! Always keep your <strong>heart pounding</strong> and <strong>pulse flowing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/e3d6ca016295ea105ed4f47bbf3a7a25.avif?t=1770497113\" width=1179 height=411 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve puzzles, feel the music</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, find hidden locks to open gates while swinging your way through the different fantastic worlds.<br>No area is the same! Use your creativity to overcome obstacles! All while enjoining <strong><i>Gun Swingers Original Themes!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/cad5983cb8e918bb5f14c928e99a3f64.avif?t=1770497113\" width=1298 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Let your creativity flow! Endless possibilities! <i><u>Endless fun!</u></i> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination take you away! <strong><u>Create your own levels!</u></strong> Using the <strong>In game Level Creator!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build walls! Build puzzles! Spawn enemies! Program gates! Build your own worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2168230/extras/c92afa4f3aa116a6bd23b7651485d791.avif?t=1770497113\" width=939 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your worlds! Share them with friends! How far can you stretch your own or others imaginations and skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i><u><br>Welcome To The World Of Gun Swinger!</u></i></strong></p>", "short_description": "Blaze away with blistering fast weapons! Never stop! Swing your self through a world without floors! No Fear! No Brakes! Gain upgrades to increase your ferocious velocity! Unlock new weapons! Solve puzzles! Or relax in the in-game level creator with endless fun and